The x87 precision control (single precision rounds results to 24 bits, in the rounding mode, keeping the
exponent range) and FST m32 in the rounding mode: programs that set single precision with chop or ceil modes.
Checked against QEMU. NaN results as the x87 makes them (the host's may differ: RISC-V's).

